# dev-notes.32 — runtime-consolidation-cleanup-v1

Date: 2026-06-09
Branch/slice: runtime-consolidation-cleanup-v1

## Purpose

Consolidate repo documentation and test fixture-helper usage after the completed parent-runtime and Worker Layout Option C modularization arcs.

This branch prepares the repo for future feature-specific planning, such as embedding support, tool/function calling, and researched multimodal/vision support, without implementing those features.

