## Documentation cleanup

The root `README.md` now acts as a developer landing page for the current repo layout, public runtime API, fast static checks, broader mock checks, and feature-branch guidance.

`docs/README.md` indexes the historical `dev-notes.*` files without renaming them. The old branch notes remain historical checkpoints and are intentionally not renamed in this branch.

`docs/current-architecture.md` records the current parent runtime and worker layout, public entrypoints, stable boundaries, test organization, and the diagnostic status of `tests/smokeTestRealRuntimeContextCancelShutdownDiagnostics.mjs`.

`docs/feature-readiness.md` records future feature-readiness notes for embeddings, tool/function calling, and multimodal/vision research without claiming implementation support.

## Fixture helper consolidation

The older fixture-copy smoke tests now reuse the shared fixture copier:

```text
tests/helpers/copyRuntimeFixture.mjs
```

They no longer carry duplicated local `RUNTIME_FILES` arrays. Their per-test fake `node-llama-cpp` packages, event logs, config text patches, environment handling, and smoke behavior remain local to each test.

`tests/tools/checkRuntimeFixtureCoverage.mjs` now treats reintroduced local `RUNTIME_FILES` arrays as drift unless explicitly allowed in the checker. The current allowed set is empty.

## Non-goals preserved

This branch does not include:

```text
embedding implementation
vision/multimodal implementation
tool/function calling implementation
node-llama-cpp API migration
model path/model identity changes
configOverride expansion
scheduler behavior changes
worker message protocol changes
prompt/output semantic changes
init/reset/shutdown behavior changes
native timeout/unhealthy behavior changes
performance tuning
real-runtime behavior changes
```

## Propagation review

Confirmed by intended patch shape:

```text
No production runtime imports changed.
No production worker imports changed.
No package entrypoints changed.
No public API exports changed.
No worker protocol shape changed.
No model identity/path behavior changed.
No prompt/output semantics changed.
Shared runtime fixture manifest remains tests/helpers/runtimeFixtureFiles.mjs.
Fixture-copy tests now consume the shared copier instead of duplicating the copy loop and manifest.
Historical dev-note paths are preserved.
```

