## Caveats

This branch is cleanup/consolidation, not feature support. Future embedding, tool/function calling, or multimodal/vision work still needs a separate plan/spec and may require real-runtime tests and API research.

The historical `dev-notes.*` files keep their existing extensionless names to avoid broad documentation churn. A future docs-only rename pass may be considered separately if Michael wants that path cleanup.

